  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of the chord <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> of the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> passing through the point&nbsp;<math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> such that <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;is given by",
